      <h>380</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>RELATIONSHIP KEY
R1: JobSearchGUI -&gt; AgentController (association)
    submits requests
R2: JobSearchCLI -&gt; AgentController (association)
    submits requests
R3: AgentController -&gt; CareerFacade (association)
    delegates
R4: CareerFacade -&gt; Repository (association)
    persists
R5: CareerFacade -&gt; CareerAgent (association)
    AI workflows
R6: CareerFacade -&gt; ToolManager (association)
    tools
R7: CareerFacade -&gt; ResumeParser (association)
    resume parsing
R8: DocumentParserAdapter -&gt; ResumeParser (realization)
fontsize=12
style=wordwrap</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes />
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>Text</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>1120</x>
      <y>1780</y>
      <w>1020</w>
      <h>380</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>RELATIONSHIP KEY
R9: CareerAgent -&gt; ToolManager (association)
    executes tools
R10: CareerAgent -&gt; LLMClient (association)
    inference
R11: OpenAIAdapter -&gt; LLMClient (realization)
R12: CareerAgent -&gt; Repository (association)
    run memory
R13: ToolManager -&gt; MatchingStrategy (aggregation)
    selected policy
R14: WeightedMatching -&gt; MatchingStrategy (realization)
R15: RequiredSkillMatching -&gt; MatchingStrategy (realization)
R16: ToolManager -&gt; Repository (association)
    retrieval
fontsize=12
style=wordwrap</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes />
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>Text</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>2160</x>
      <y>1780</y>
      <w>1020</w>
      <h>380</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>RELATIONSHIP KEY
R17: CareerFacade -&gt; DeadlineManager (association)
    deadline workflow
R18: DeadlineManager -&gt; DeadlineObserver (aggregation)
    subscribers
R19: JobSearchGUI -&gt; DeadlineObserver (realization)
R20: JobSearchCLI -&gt; DeadlineObserver (realization)
R21: DeadlineManager -&gt; Repository (association)
    reads deadlines
R22: CandidateProfile -&gt; Resume (composition)
    resume versions
R23: CandidateProfile -&gt; Application (association)
    tracks
R24: Application -&gt; Job (association)
    for job
