    <panel_attributes>RELATIONSHIP KEY
R25: CandidateProfile -&gt; InterviewSession (composition)
    owns sessions
R26: InterviewSession -&gt; Job (association)
    prepares for
R27: CareerDocument -&gt; CandidateProfile (association)
    owner
R28: CareerFacade -&gt; CandidateProfile (dependency)
    creates/updates domain objects
R29: CareerFacade -&gt; CompanyNotes (dependency)
    creates and updates notes: manageCompanyNotes()
R30: ToolManager -&gt; CompanyNotes (dependency)
    retrieves stored notes: readNotes()
